    (`?⏎  - a⏎: w`, `- ?⏎  - a⏎  : w`). -/
example {sp sp₂ sp' : SurfPos} (h_ssl : SSLComments sp sp₂)
    (h_entries : SBlockSeqEntries 2 sp₂ sp') :
